OL,3,GNEWSAPCs 'lost control' with amputee,
OL,4,A92, in care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers lost control when
OL,7,Fthey Tasered and Pava-sprayed a
OL,8,F92-year-old amputee who "posed no real
OL,9,For credible threat to anyone", a Sussex
OL,10,FPolice disciplinary hearing has heard.
OL,12,FGross misconduct proceedings began on
OL,13,FMonday for PC Stephen Smith, 52, and PC
OL,14,FRachel Comotto, 37, following an
OL,15,Fincident in June 2022 at the Park Beck
OL,16,Fcare home in St Leonards-on-Sea.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
