OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPCs 'lost control' with amputee,
OL,4,A92, in care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May 2025, the officers were found
OL,7,Fnot guilty of assault occasioning
OL,8,Factual bodily harm. The trial heard
OL,9,FSmith used incapacitating Pava spray
OL,10,Fand a baton on Donald Burgess, while
OL,11,FComotto deployed her Taser.
OL,13,FOpening the misconduct hearing, force
OL,14,Flawyer Aaron Rathmell said the
OL,15,F"officers acted, hastily, harshly and
OL,16,Flost control".
